  "Gardienne au contact, cracheuse à distance et tête mixte. Deux gardes et un soigneur escortent le roi ; la mêlée brise ses plaques. S’il atteint le cristal, la partie est perdue !": "A guard head for melee, a spitter head for ranged attacks, and a mixed head. Two guards and a healer escort the King. Melee attacks break his armor plates. If he reaches the Crystal, you lose!",
