  "pour gagner. Ton camp doit rester debout. Si le roi entre, la partie est perdue ! Il pond des œufs pendant la dernière vague. Sa tête gardienne protège son corps : les combattants au contact brisent plus vite ses protections. Sa tête cracheuse annonce au sol la zone de son prochain tir, qui frappe une seule fois. Des boucliers près de tes tireurs peuvent amortir ses tirs. Chaque nouvelle phase peut apporter une protection.": "to win. Your camp must stay standing. If the king gets in, the game is lost! He lays eggs during the last wave. His guardian head protects his body: allies who fight up close break his shields faster. His spitting head marks the ground before its next shot, which hits just once. Shield Guards near your ranged allies can soften his shots. Each new phase may bring a shield.",
